Subject: estimation issues with multistate m-array in jags
Message-ID: <QlY50OKMvRk.StFdy219AQAJ@hmecology.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/hmecology/c/QlY50OKMvRk/m/StFdy219AQAJ>
